(## Executive summary) Tj
0 -15 Td
(A research assistant that answers only from an immutable corpus, cites evidence,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(handles supersession and abstention, and remembers safe user context across restarts.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(The baseline is frozen; the improved configuration adds seven typed agent stages.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## Reproduction) Tj
0 -15 Td
(uv sync) Tj
0 -15 Td
(uv run pytest -q) Tj
0 -15 Td
(uv run asterline ask "What is the current Launch ingestion rate?" --provider fake) Tj
0 -15 Td
(uv run asterline run) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
