(## Evidence and memory guarantees) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Citations are parsed and validated against retrieved chunks. Memory is labelled) Tj
0 -15 Td
(unverified context and never counts as company evidence. Secrets and sensitive) Tj
0 -15 Td
(personal data are redacted or rejected before storage and tracing. SQLite is the) Tj
0 -15 Td
(source of truth; hard delete removes memory rows, vectors, sessions, and messages.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## Provider resilience smoke) Tj
0 -15 Td
(A real Gemini request returned HTTP 429 \(quota exhausted\); the app recorded the) Tj
0 -15 Td
(sanitized primary error and successfully served the answer through the locally) Tj
0 -15 Td
(installed Ollama llama3.2:3b model with a citation validated against retrieved evidence.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(This is a resilience smoke test, not a Gemini answer-quality evaluation.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## Limitations) Tj
0 -15 Td
(FakeLLM reports verify plumbing, not provider quality. Gemini quality runs and) Tj
0 -15 Td
(remote LangSmith links require the author's credentials and quota. Deleted data) Tj
0 -15 Td
(may remain in already-shipped remote traces. Regex matching is a rough metric.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## AI use disclosure) Tj
0 -15 Td
(# AI use disclosure) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
